# Negative-control mutant — the consolidation form opens only where legacy shows it (W1, AC-9/AC-11)
#
# Legacy `cProdInvoiceConsolidationComp.vue:74-97` shows the consolidation
#   component only when `isVisible`/`canConsolidate` hold: a live subscription
#   that is not staged, whose client setting enables (or inherits) consolidation,
#   and whose product allows it. The machine's `consolidating.idle` open
#   transition guards on `canConsolidate`, which ports those RECORD-level parts
#   (the brand `INVOICE_CONSOLIDATION_ENABLED`/actor-restrict config and the
#   `update_contract_product` permission are NOT read — design 8.3, reported).
# Mutation: reverts the open guard to bare `isSubscription`, so the consolidation
#   form opens for any subscription regardless of the client/product
#   `invoice_consolidation_enabled` facts.
#
# NO EXISTING TEST FLIPS THIS MUTANT. Every consolidation test in
#   contract-product.mutations.int.test.ts opens on the recorded fixture, whose
#   client and product `invoice_consolidation_enabled` are both ENABLED (1), so
#   `canConsolidate` and bare `isSubscription` agree. The refusal tests only
#   exercise the one-off / staged / cancelled cases, which fail
#   `isSubscription`/`stagedImport`, not the config gate. The prover must add a
#   scenario: a live subscription whose client `invoice_consolidation_enabled`
#   is DISABLED (0) — or whose product consolidation is DISABLED — asserting the
#   consolidation form is refused (no `consolidation` slot, no request). This
#   patch is the negative control that test must flip.
#
# Apply with:  git apply <this file>   (run from repo root)
# Revert with: git apply -R <this file>
diff --git a/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.machine.ts b/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.machine.ts
index 3360d45f6..e153fc83b 100644
--- a/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.machine.ts
+++ b/packages/headless/src/modules/contract-product/contract-product.machine.ts
@@ -318,7 +318,7 @@ export const contractProductMachine = createMachine(
                   CONSOLIDATION: {
                     target: "available",
                     actions: "setConsolidationSchemas",
-                    cond: "canConsolidate"
+                    cond: "isSubscription"
                   }
                 }
               },
